#show Lin
# sprite Lin Think
Lin: Let's call it a day.
# sprite Lin Normal

Lin: You can continue using this system in the evening. I've set the access to 24 hours.

Lin: The lab door access—your keycard should already have clearance.
# sprite Lin LookAway
Lin: Oh, one more thing—

Lin: This system has a... peculiarity.

Lin: It remembers your operating patterns.
# sprite Lin Normal
Lin: If you constantly try to forcefully control every detail, the system becomes increasingly unstable.

Lin: But if you learn to observe, to know when to let go...
# sprite Lin Think
She smiles slightly.
# sprite Lin Normal
Lin: You'll find ecosystems are more resilient than you imagine.

Lin: Take your time exploring. The data saves automatically—I'll review it daily.

She walks toward the door.

Lin: Good night, intern. Don't stay up too late.
#hide Lin

->END

